# Amar Ujala

> Amar Ujala is one of India's largest Hindi-language digital news platforms, delivering breaking news, in-depth coverage, and analysis across national, international, business, sports, entertainment, and regional topics. It serves millions of readers daily, primarily across North India, with content in Hindi and English.

## About
- Language: Primarily Hindi (Devanagari), with English content
- Coverage: National, International, State/Regional, Politics, Business, Sports, Entertainment, Technology, Health, Education, Lifestyle, Religion/Spirituality
- Audience: Hindi-speaking readers across India, especially Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand, Haryana, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, Jammu & Kashmir, and Delhi-NCR
- Format: Articles, photo galleries, videos, live blogs, web stories, e-paper

